20 considered wages pursuant to RSA 275:42, III and due upon separation from employment pursuant
21 toRSA275:44.
22 (a) When an employer does not delineate the types of paid time off awarded to an
23 employee, as described in RSA 275:43, I, the entire balance of unused paid time off shall be prorated
